{"slug":"k-zz-m","ar":"ك ظ م","total":6,"core":"suppressing; restraining grief","forms":[{"ar":"كَظِيم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"suppressing grief","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":58,"p":9,"ar":["وَإِذَا","بُشِّرَ","أَحَدُهُم","بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ","ظَلَّ","وَجْهُهُۥ","مُسْوَدًّا","وَهُوَ","كَظِيمٌ"],"en":"And when one of them is informed of [the birth of] a female, his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief"}},{"ar":"كَٰظِمِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"those who restrain","word":null,"ex":{"s":3,"a":134,"p":6,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُنفِقُونَ","فِى","ٱلسَّرَّآءِ","وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ","وَٱلْكَـٰظِمِينَ","ٱلْغَيْظَ","وَٱلْعَافِينَ","عَنِ","ٱلنَّاسِ ۗ","وَٱللَّهُ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"en":"Who spend [in the cause of Allah] during ease and hardship and who restrain anger and who pardon the people - and Allah loves the doers of good"}},{"ar":"مَكْظُوم","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"distressed, full of grief","word":null,"ex":{"s":68,"a":48,"p":11,"ar":["فَٱصْبِرْ","لِحُكْمِ","رَبِّكَ","وَلَا","تَكُن","كَصَاحِبِ","ٱلْحُوتِ","إِذْ","نَادَىٰ","وَهُوَ","مَكْظُومٌ"],"en":"Then be patient for the decision of your Lord, [O Muhammad], and be not like the companion of the fish when he called out while he was distressed"}}],"surahs":[[3,1],[12,1],[16,1],[40,1],[43,1],[68,1]]}